  "note": "Election of the Dungannon Urban Council, ordinary day 15 May 1936; seven nominations were received for each of the three wards, so all twenty-one were returned unopposed, fourteen Unionists and seven Nationalists (Belfast News-Letter, 7 May 1936, p. 15). Returned unopposed. Returned unopposed."
